					"hotel_id": 2,
					"rate": 3,
					"comment": "I enjoyed myself so much. The room I was in was definitely for one person. It was small (I prefer the term \u201cEuropean\u201d), but had everything I needed. The shower was wonderful, the air conditioning worked so well in the 90+ degree heat, and the bed was very comfy. The people working there (everyone whose names I forgot to get, but especially James and Dana) were great at giving me ideas of where to eat in the neighborhood. Reese was a wonderful bartender, as was Vicki(?). Very fun. The location is great. Walking distance from the Mall, and very near the Foggy Bottom \u2014GWU metro stop which has 3 lines that can take you",
